# This file MUST live at the repository root: both images are built with `context: .` (the repo
# root) and `dockerfile: docker/Kbot.*.Dockerfile`, and BuildKit only consults
# `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` or `<context>/.dockerignore`. A copy under docker/ is never
# read, which is why every entry below used to have no effect at all.
#
# The Dockerfiles only need: nuget.config, Directory.Build.props, Directory.Packages.props and
# src/. Everything else is excluded -- the publish output becomes the image, so anything that
# reaches the build context is a potential leak.

# --- Version control, CI and editor state -------------------------------------
**/.classpath
**/.dockerignore
**/*.env
**/.git
.github
**/.gitignore
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# --- Build output and test artefacts ------------------------------------------
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/*.trx
test

# --- Packaging / tooling not used by the image builds -------------------------
# `docker` covers this repo's Dockerfiles, example-compose.yaml and stack.env in one line; the
# `Dockerfile*` / `compose*` globs below only match those exact prefixes, which nothing here uses.
# The Dockerfile passed with `-f` is read by the client, not through the build context, so
# excluding the directory is safe.
docker
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log

# --- Documentation and assets -------------------------------------------------
docs
*.md
LICENSE
btc_adress_qr.png

# --- Local secrets, state and logs --------------------------------------------
# Secrets reach the containers through the mounted docker secret files
# (/run/secrets/dca-secrets, /run/secrets/mail-secrets) and environment variables, and state
# lives in the mounted state/ volume -- never through the build context. The two glob shapes
# mirror .gitignore's `*secrets.json` / `*state.json`.
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*secrets.json
**/secrets*template.json
**/*state.json
**/state
**/logs
